<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n83781" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πληθ-ύς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ύος</span>, ἡ, 
			Ep.
		 dat. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πληθυῖ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					22.458
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				11.514
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				16.105
			</span></i>:—
				Ion.
			 for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλῆθος,</span>
			<i>throng, crowd,</i> of people, Hom.ll. cc.; 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δῆμος</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Leg.Gort.</u>
				6.52
			</span></i>; <i>majority,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πληθὺν δὲ νικῆν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					9(1).333.18
				</span></i>
			 (
				Locr.
			, <span class="entity">v B.C.</span>): as Noun of multitude with pl.
			Verb, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὣς φάσαν ἡ π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					2.278
				</span></i>
			: in later Prose, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ax.</u>
				366b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>3 Ma.</u>
				4.17
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς στρατιᾶς τὴν π. συχνήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Pomp.</u>
					39
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Cont.</u>
				15
			</span></i>, etc.; = Lat. <i>plebs,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				7.16
			</span></i>, etc. [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῡ</span> in nom.
			and acc. sg., in other cases <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῠ.</span>]</div>
